    {
      "id": "how-to-use",
      "x": 1450,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 320,
      "text": "Real screens, rebuilt from the app's own tokens.\n\nEdit anything: drag, retype, restyle in the properties panel. Save keeps your version.\n\nThen tell Claude Code what changed."
    },
    {
      "id": "type",
      "x": 1450,
      "y": 280,
      "w": 320,
      "text": "TYPE\n\nGetai Grotesk Black — display 40, title 24, logo. It has no · › ✓ ✗ glyphs, so it stays on the big stuff.\n\nAspekta — headline 18/700, body 15/400, label 13/500, caption 11/400."
    },
    {
      "id": "system",
      "x": 1450,
      "y": 620,
      "w": 320,
      "text": "SYSTEM\n\nground #F5F5F5 · ink #212431 · slate #4F5D75 · accent #EA5C1F · notice #DDE0E6\nstatus: clear #9BF06B · upcoming #FF90E8 · ongoing #FF5C5C · ended #FFD93D\n\nborder 2px · shadow 4px hard · radius 5 (was 2)"
    },
    {
      "id": "accent",
      "x": 1450,
      "y": 980,
      "w": 320,
      "text": "Accent orange has three homes only: the primary button, the tour ring, and the quote rule on Detail. Least used, most noticed."
